WEBVTT

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:05.390
Who are your regulars, who hasn't been back for a while, and who spends the most?

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:08.372
VaraaAi's customer book keeps track of all of it,

00:00:08.322 --> 00:00:10.270
straight from your salon's bookings.

00:00:10.842 --> 00:00:12.036
Tap Customers.

00:00:12.134 --> 00:00:13.796
At the top are the key numbers:

00:00:13.973 --> 00:00:18.832
how many customers you have, new customers in the last thirty days, the return rate,

00:00:18.782 --> 00:00:20.836
and the average spend per customer.

00:00:21.424 --> 00:00:23.074
Below are the customer groups:

00:00:23.165 --> 00:00:28.274
All, VIP, Regulars, New, Booked ahead, and Haven't been back.

00:00:28.703 --> 00:00:30.354
Tap a group to filter the list.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.594
The search box finds customers by name, email, or phone number.

00:00:35.142 --> 00:00:36.848
Two very useful buttons:

00:00:36.957 --> 00:00:40.128
Export to Excel, to download the group you're looking at.

00:00:40.396 --> 00:00:44.448
And Email this group, to send an offer to exactly those customers.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:47.180
Tap a customer to open their profile.

00:00:47.272 --> 00:00:51.251
You'll see their completed visits, total spend, favourite service,

00:00:51.201 --> 00:00:52.620
and usual staff member.

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:56.899
The Private note is seen only by your salon, for example an allergy,

00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:58.140
or a favourite colour.

00:00:58.489 --> 00:01:00.860
At the bottom is the customer's booking history.

00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:02.300
Now take the quiz below.
